  "description": "A read-only command-line analyzer for Microsoft SQL Server: ranks queries by what they cost the server, shows execution plans, inventories indexes with their real usage, and reports unused, duplicate, redundant and missing indexes — plus wait statistics, live blocking chains, statistics freshness and deadlock history. Emits a stable JSON contract or a table. Never writes to your database.",
